        "BossName": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_ActorName.ST_ActorName",
          "Key": "Anomaly_002_Name",
          "SourceString": "黑之书",
          "LocalizedString": "Black Tome"
        },
        "ContentDes": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Ui.ST_Ui",
          "Key": "DT_MonsterDropBox_BlackBook",
          "SourceString": "掩藏黑渊中的罪孽终将得到彼岸的审判，成为吾主吧，只需要写下……你的名字。你的名字是？你的名字是？你的名字是？你的名字是？你的名字是？你的名字是？你的名字是？\r\n「你的名字是？」",
          "LocalizedString": "The sins hidden in the dark abyss will finally face judgment from the other shore. To become my master, you need only write… your… name. What is your name? What is your name? What is your name? What is your name? What is your name? What is your name? What is your name?\r\n\"What is your name?\""
        },
