          "SourceString": "音霸魔王",
          "LocalizedString": "Beat King"
        },
        "ContentDes": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Ui.ST_Ui",
          "Key": "DT_MonsterDropBox_BeatGame",
          "SourceString": "跟随着音乐的节奏，只需要在恰当的时机，轻轻按下，恭喜您，您已经学会如何玩音游了。\r\n「恭喜，你在本次挑战中获得了99个完美以及1个很好。」",
          "LocalizedString": "Follow the beat, press buttons when the time is right… And there you have it! You are now a rhythm gamer!\r\n\"Congratulations, you achieved 99 Perfects and 1 Great in this challenge.\""
        },
