          "Key": "boss_19_Name",
          "SourceString": "海囚",
          "LocalizedString": "Sea Prisoner"
        },
        "ContentDes": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Ui.ST_Ui",
          "Key": "DT_MonsterDropBox_HaiQiu",
          "SourceString": "在此异象空间中，巨大的鲸鱼被捕鲸船的锁链困住，不断遭到折磨，鲸鱼在寻找能帮助它毁掉锁链的强大之人。\r\n「歌声是它的呼救。」",
          "LocalizedString": "Within this Anomalous Realm, a massive whale is bound by chains from a whaling ship. Suffering, the whale searches for someone powerful enough to help destroy its bindings.\r\n\"Its song is a cry for help.\""
        },
