        "BossName": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_ActorName.ST_ActorName",
          "Key": "boss_33_name",
          "SourceString": "囿巢鸟",
          "LocalizedString": "Nestbound Bird"
        },
        "ContentDes": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Ui.ST_Ui",
          "Key": "DT_MonsterDropBox_YouChaoNiao",
          "SourceString": "暗中结巢的鸟母，会以温柔慈爱的女性声音呼唤迷路的儿童，询问他们是否想成为自己的孩子，倘若答应，那孩子就会永远留在鸟母的巢中。\r\n「不要夺走我的孩子……」",
          "LocalizedString": "The mother bird that nests in the shadows calls out to lost hatchlings with a gentle, loving female chirp, asking if they would like to become her hatchlings. Should they agree, they will remain in the bird's nest forever.\r\n\"Don't take my hatchlings away from me…\""
